# Kubebuilder / Project Layout

Domain: `altech.com`. Module: `altech.com/operator`. Primary CR: `Cleaner` (`apps.altech.com/v1`).

## Never edit (regenerated)

- `config/crd/bases/*.yaml`, `config/rbac/role.yaml`, `config/webhook/manifests.yaml` → `make manifests`
- `**/zz_generated.*.go` → `make generate`
- `PROJECT` → only via `kubebuilder` CLI

## Scaffold markers

Do not remove `// +kubebuilder:scaffold:*` comments.

## After API / marker changes

```sh
make manifests generate
make lint-fix test
```

## Create APIs / webhooks

Use CLI only — do not hand-create API or webhook files:

```sh
kubebuilder create api --group <group> --version <version> --kind <Kind>
kubebuilder create webhook --group <group> --version <version> --kind <Kind> ...
```

## Layout

Keep single-group layout unless `multigroup: true` is set in `PROJECT`. Do not move `api/`, `internal/controller/`, or `config/` paths arbitrarily.
